.el .ds Aq '
.TH rev-stealth-hermes-verify 1  "rev-stealth-hermes-verify " 
.SH NAME
rev\-stealth\-hermes\-verify \- Verify a Hermes plugin install on disk
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrev\-stealth hermes verify\fR [\fB\-\-prefix\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-python\-check\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Verify a Hermes plugin install on disk. Checks the required files are present and (by default) runs a python3 ast.parse syntax probe on __init__.py. Use \-\-skip\-python\-check on hosts without python3.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-prefix\fR \fI<PREFIX>\fR
Plugin directory to verify. Defaults to `$HOME/.hermes/plugins/rev\-scraping\-mcp`
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-python\-check\fR
Skip the `python3 \-c "import ast; ast.parse(...)"` syntax probe of `__init__.py`. The probe runs by default; pass this flag in environments without `python3` on `$PATH` (minimal containers, CI workers without the Python toolchain)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  $ rev\-stealth hermes verify
  $ rev\-stealth hermes verify \-\-prefix /opt/hermes/plugins/rev\-scraping\-mcp
  $ rev\-stealth hermes verify \-\-skip\-python\-check

EXIT CODES:
  0  Ok               Plugin verified.
  1  UserError        Bad \-\-prefix.
  3  PermanentError   Required files missing or python3 ast.parse failed.

ENV:
  (none consumed directly; respects HOME for default \-\-prefix.)
